cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SimTwin, please cite the software and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "SimTwin: a reproducible digital-twin simulator for networked FDM/FFF additive-manufacturing fleets"
abstract: >-
  SimTwin simulates a fleet of fused-filament additive-manufacturing
  printers, the network connecting them, and the digital twins observing them.
  Twin state is written only by messages that survive an explicit delivery-semantics
  pipeline, and faults are implemented as mechanisms acting on the physical plant
  rather than as labels on telemetry, so twin staleness, synchronisation delay,
  resynchronisation counts and fault-signature separability are measurable outcomes
  of the model.
type: software
authors:
